{"unit_id":"BillyChen123__qdd#card-zh","repo":"BillyChen123/qdd","commit":"f5d2c93c6c5067c0c71a3ce135234d594e64edbe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"QDD 是面向生物医学科研发现的 DSH 插件，提供命令行和 Web 面板。它通过 DSH bundle 注册 qdd-panel 与 qdd-preset，并将研究项目组织成问题、假设、study、task、证据和产物的可追踪工作流。用户可以初始化项目、管理研究阶段、检查项目状态，并通过 Auto Mode 让 agent 按阶段推进研究任务；面板可查看状态并切换 human/auto 模式。适合需要长期维护研究脉络、审计中间结果并协同 agent 的科研人员。Auto Mode 需要 Anthropic-compatible 模型凭据；使用 DSH 面板需要相应的 Web 客户端。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","src/runtime/dsh-assets/qdd-panel/lib/index.js:1-21","src/runtime/dsh-assets/plugins/qdd-auto.mjs:1-8","src/cli/index.ts:22-55","src/commands/add-study.ts:11-24"]}
{"unit_id":"BillyChen123__qdd#card-en","repo":"BillyChen123/qdd","commit":"f5d2c93c6c5067c0c71a3ce135234d594e64edbe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"QDD is a DSH research workflow plugin with CLI and Web panel. It tracks questions, hypotheses, studies, tasks, evidence, and artifacts. Users can initialize projects, validate state, and advance research in stages with Auto Mode. The panel shows project status and supports human or auto mode.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:1-9","src/runtime/dsh-assets/qdd-panel/lib/index.js:1-21","src/runtime/dsh-assets/plugins/qdd-auto.mjs:1-8","src/cli/index.ts:22-55","src/commands/add-study.ts:11-24"]}
